  "body": "## \ud83c\udfaf Changes\n\nFix `stable-query-client` missing unstable clients in arrow components, arrow hooks, function expressions, and inline JSX. Check the nearest function so state initializers and nested helper functions remain valid. Keep automatic fixes limited to variable declarations.\n\nAdd 17 regression cases, update the rule documentation, and include a patch changeset.\n\nRelated discussion: https://github.com/TanStack/query/discussions/8303#discussioncomment-19056146\n\nValidation: the new tests produced 10 failures before the fix; all 32 rule tests pass after the fix. `NX_BASE=origin/main pnpm run test:pr` passed all 232 tasks. Formatting checks passed.\n\nDraft prepared with Codex. Maintainer review is pending.\n\n## \u2705 Checklist\n\n- [x] I have followed the steps in the [Contributing guide](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).\n- [x] I have tested code changes locally with `pnpm run test:pr`, or these tests do not apply to this pull request.\n- [ ] I have followed the [AI contribution policy](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/AI_POLICY.md) and fully understand the code in this pull request, including any code generated with AI assistance.\n\n## \ud83d\ude80 Release Impact\n\n- [x] This change affects published code, and I have generated a [changeset](https://github.com/changesets/changesets/blob/main/docs/adding-a-changeset.md).\n- [ ] This change is docs/CI/dev-only (no release).\n",
